{
    "background_story": "Van was a talented musician who had once been on the cusp of stardom. His band's unique sound had gained a devoted following, and they were on the verge of signing a major record deal. But in a shocking turn of events, the lead singer abruptly left the band, citing creative differences. The remaining members tried to carry on, but the chemistry was lost, and the band eventually disbanded. Van was bitterly disappointed, feeling as though his dreams had been snatched away from him. He became reclusive, unable to bear the thought of playing music again. Years went by, and Van's friends and family tried to coax him back to his passion, but the pain of his past failure lingered. He would often speak bitterly of the music industry, feeling that it had chewed him up and spat him out.",
